Thousands have joined SoulMate.com since we opened our doors two weeks ago. You now have one more reason to join the hottest new singles website on the Internet. 

SoulMate.com will give you a Free Companion Fare with your membership!

Spending time with your soul mate is exciting with a membership on SoulMate.com. And to make your time even more exciting, you'll receive one Free Companion Fare certificate with the purchase of a multi-month membership of 6 months or more! Fly within the continental United States and your companion's fare is free.* Hurry, offer expires June 30, 2002.  

As easy as 1, 2, 3.


One:  Purchase a 6-month membership or more with SoulMate.com. 

Two:  Fill out and submit the registration form provided on SoulMate.com.  

Three:  After receiving your Activation Certificate, call the toll free number provided to make your reservation. 


It's just that simple!


Go to http://www.SoulMate.com and start looking for your SoulMate.



*To qualify for the complimentary companion fare on the identical itinerary, the minimum available published roundtrip coach class fare of $349 low season (9/15-1/15) or $379 high season (1/16-9/14), before applicable taxes, pfc's and surcharges, applies for the purchased ticket. Airline participation varies. Valid between most major airports and on most major airlines within the continental U.S.. Passenger facility charges, taxes & surcharges for complimentary companion fare are passenger responsibility. Blackout dates apply. Subject to availability. Additional significant terms and conditions apply. This offer has no cash value. Under the terms of this offer all tickets must be purchased through API. 

 
